<title>DUBAI: UAE central bank foreign reserves flat in October.</title>
<headline>UAE central bank foreign reserves flat in October.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United Arab Emirates foreign currency reserves were steady in October 1996 at 27.3 billion dirhams, Central Bank figures show.</p>
<p>(Millions of dirhams, rounded)</p>
<p>						  October 1996     September</p>
<p>1996 Assets: Gold				700		    700</p>
<p>Foreign					 27,300		 27,300</p>
<p>Other assets				     500		  1,100</p>
<p>Total assets				  28,500		 29,100</p>
<p>Liabilities: Certificates of deposit   6,000		  6,300</p>
<p>Other liabilities			    1,000		  1,200</p>
</text>
